WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.433
The drivers are getting themselves ready.
车手们正在做准备。

00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:03.700
Well, I wonder who this man is.
哦，来看看这位是谁。

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.000
Wang Yibo is getting himself ready,
王一博正在做准备，

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.700
much to the delight of the crowd.
现场观众随即爆发出热烈欢呼。

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.600
They've gone ballistic.
现场彻底沸腾了。

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.766
They've seen their boy.
他们看到了自己支持的车手。

00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:13.600
And now that we've got this gap between the two sessions,
现在，趁着两个赛段之间的这段空档，

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.133
we can clearly hear the cheers of the crowd
我们可以清楚地听见现场的欢呼声，

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.200
over the roar of the engines.
甚至盖过了引擎的轰鸣。

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.233
The cars are coming in.
赛车正在驶回维修区。

00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:20.500
He's backed by Red Bull this season.
本赛季，他获得了红牛的支持。

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.133
There he is.
他出现了。

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.733
Oh, my word!
我的天哪！

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.800
Several thousand spectators have flocked to Shanghai,
数千名观众涌入了上海国际赛车场，

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.066
and some have even been here since yesterday.
有些人甚至从昨天起便已来到现场。

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:32.600
All very keen to keep an eye on this driver,
大家都迫不及待地想关注这位车手，

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.033
who, I have to say, is really stepping up to the plate
我必须说，他确实正在证明自己，

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.266
as a professional racing driver.
展现出一名职业车手应有的水准。

00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:39.466
Listen to that!
听听现场的欢呼声！

00:00:39.466 --> 00:00:43.566
I was actually in conversation with Elias Seppänen yesterday,
昨天，我与埃利亚斯·塞帕宁聊了不少，

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:44.800
and one thing he mentioned
其中他特别提到了一点：

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.300
was that he had worked with gentleman drivers before.
他过去曾与绅士车手合作，

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.733
He has worked with gentleman drivers before.
此前确实搭档过这类车手，

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:52.900
He's worked with drivers competing at the amateur level,
也与参加业余组别的车手合作过，

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:56.466
but never before has he seen this level of professionalism
但他此前从未见过如此专业的态度，

00:00:56.466 --> 00:00:59.200
from the person sitting next to him in the team awning,
无论是此刻坐在车队帐篷中、位于他身旁的车手，

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.000
or even from the other amateur drivers in the teams.
还是其他车队的业余车手，都是如此。
